<title>PORTUGAL: Portuguese escudo edges lower against mark.</title>
<headline>Portuguese escudo edges lower against mark.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The escudo was slightly weaker against the mark, compared with its close on Wednesday ahead of the May Day holiday, but volumes were thin and expected to remain so, traders said.</p>
<p>The currency was trading at 100.34/37 to the mark against 100.28/31 at the previous close.</p>
<p>It was seen trading in a range of 100.30/40 on Friday.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
